            "required_age": 0,
            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Seclusion: Islesbury</strong> is a new horror point-and-click adventure in the vein of genre classics such as <strong>Scratches</strong> and <strong>Dark Fall</strong>.</i> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bright morning sunlight washes over Detective Jason Endel's bed. The gentle silence does not bring comfort. Jason wants peace of mind, a way to make the pain go away. Something urges him to leave, but little he knows of the nightmarish journey awaiting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Islesbury is a town fading away after a series of violent and unexplained riots. Empty streets, buildings in ruins, rumors of locals descending into madness, strange sounds around every corner that no one can identify...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And so Jason arrives one night heeding a dreamlike call, a reckoning of the past.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore detailed locations ranging from desolated apartments to lonely streets, dark woods to dangerous cliffs, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel the secrets of a mysterious town with a sinister past.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve logical puzzles that will challenge you and reveal an engrossing story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a friendly inventory system and consult a journal to keep track of your investigations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surrender to a haunting original soundtrack.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can a decade-old murder case be solved? Is it safe to wander on these streets? Will anyone help you in this town? Find it out in this tale of personal tragedy.</strong></p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Seclusion: Islesbury</strong> is a new horror point-and-click adventure in the vein of genre classics such as <strong>Scratches</strong> and <strong>Dark Fall</strong>.</i> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bright morning sunlight washes over Detective Jason Endel's bed. The gentle silence does not bring comfort. Jason wants peace of mind, a way to make the pain go away. Something urges him to leave, but little he knows of the nightmarish journey awaiting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Islesbury is a town fading away after a series of violent and unexplained riots. Empty streets, buildings in ruins, rumors of locals descending into madness, strange sounds around every corner that no one can identify...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And so Jason arrives one night heeding a dreamlike call, a reckoning of the past.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore detailed locations ranging from desolated apartments to lonely streets, dark woods to dangerous cliffs, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel the secrets of a mysterious town with a sinister past.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve logical puzzles that will challenge you and reveal an engrossing story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a friendly inventory system and consult a journal to keep track of your investigations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surrender to a haunting original soundtrack.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can a decade-old murder case be solved? Is it safe to wander on these streets? Will anyone help you in this town? Find it out in this tale of personal tragedy.</strong></p>",
